<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/establish-monitoring-regime-appropriate-to-the-individual-generally-hourly-blood-glucose-na-k-urea-and-calculated-osmolality-2xna-glucose-urea-for-the-first-6-hours-then-2-hourly-osmolality-if-the-response-is-satisfactory-i-e-a-fall-of-3-0-8-0-mosm-kg-hr> a dmo:Recommendation ;
