<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/if-there-is-significant-ketonaemia-3ß-hydroxybutyrate-3-0-mmol-l-or-ketonuria-2-with-a-ph-7-3-and-bicarbonate-15-mmol-l-i-e-mixed-dka-and-hhs-and-use-the-dka-guideline-at-0-1-units-kg-hr> a dmo:Recommendation ;
