    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "IV fluid replacement should aim to achieve a positive balance of 3-6 litres during the first 12 hours and the remaining replacement of estimated fluid loss during the following 12 hours, although complete normalisation of biochemistry may take up to 72 hours" ;
